# Story 3.3 — keep the docker build context lean. The codex-runner image
# (runners/codex/Dockerfile, context: repo root) only needs runners/codex/**;
# excluding the heavy trees keeps `docker compose build codex-runner` and the
# Docker-tier conformance test fast and small.
.git
**/target
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
_bmad-output
.agents
.claude
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
**/*.log
**/*.diff
**/.local-*.sh
